Subject: [PATCH] Leave garbage collection out of request CPU, collect idle
 isolates and size the runtime heap

Ported from the 0.5.3 series 0011

Restore bounded GC CPU exclusion, pause events, and the static isolate heap limit. Idle collector registration and lifecycle collection snapshots remain deferred; their lifecycle owner is not part of this change.

